stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Initializing
  Initializing --> Normal: Required initialization succeeds
  Initializing --> SensorFault: Required sensor unavailable
  Normal --> Caution: Persistent elevated-risk condition
  Caution --> Normal: Condition cleared with hysteresis
  Caution --> Alert: High-risk condition
  Alert --> Caution: Severity reduces under reset rules
  Normal --> Emergency: Manual SOS or validated emergency event
  Caution --> Emergency: Manual SOS or validated emergency event
  Alert --> Emergency: Manual SOS or validated emergency event
  SensorFault --> Normal: Fault cleared and data valid
  SensorFault --> Emergency: Manual SOS remains available
  Emergency --> Normal: Explicit reset/acknowledgement policy satisfied
